{"product_id":"the-richard-laymon-collection-darkness-tell-us-and-one-rainy-night-v-7","title":"The Richard Laymon Collection: \"Darkness Tell Us\" AND \"One Rainy Night\" v. 7","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fantastically gripping thriller from the best-selling author of The Snowman.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eChristmas shoppers stop to hear a Salvation Army concert on a crowded Oslo street. A gunshot cuts through the music and the bitter cold: one of the singers falls dead, shot in the head at point-blank range. Harry Hole—the Oslo Police Department’s best investigator and worst civil servant—has little to work with: no suspect, no weapon, and no motive. But Harry’s troubles will multiply. As the search closes in, the killer becomes increasingly desperate, and Harry’s chase takes him to the most forbidden corners of the former Yugoslavia.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eYet it’s when he returns to Oslo that he encounters true darkness: among the homeless junkies and Salvationists, eagerly awaiting a savior to deliver them from misery—whether he brings new life or immediate death.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith its shrewdly vertiginous narrative, acid-etched characters, and white-hot pace, The Redeemer is resounding proof of Jo Nesbø’s standing as one of the best crime writers of our time\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Richard Laymon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755331741\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 768\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 49 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594343714969,"sku":"9RF9780755331741","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-darkness-tell-us-and-one-rainy-night-v-7-444634.jpg?v=1694792484","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-darkness-tell-us-and-one-rainy-night-v-7","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}